WEBVTT

00:24.210 --> 00:25.780
The special train will pass through

00:25.780 --> 00:27.600
the tunnel where we're lying in wait
at 12:30.

00:27.600 --> 00:28.670
Stay focused—

00:30.460 --> 00:32.840
we'll only have 20 seconds
to board the train.

00:32.840 --> 00:33.340
Got it.

00:41.450 --> 00:44.230
[Mo Yungao's Special Train
from Guangchuan to Nanling]

01:59.120 --> 02:00.450
What are you looking at?

02:02.180 --> 02:03.360
Nothing. Just rest.

02:05.720 --> 02:06.660
After this trip,

02:06.710 --> 02:07.550
let's go get a drink.

02:07.550 --> 02:08.100
Sure.

03:48.840 --> 03:55.050
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

03:55.470 --> 03:58.090
[Episode 21]

04:14.820 --> 04:17.519
[Mo Yungao, Leader
of the Mo Faction Warlord of Beilian]

04:26.450 --> 04:27.930
You do enjoy

04:28.300 --> 04:29.570
bringing me useless people

04:29.570 --> 04:31.500
to keep me entertained, don't you?

04:32.130 --> 04:33.390
You need to be patient.

04:36.560 --> 04:38.740
Are you telling me what to do now?

04:38.930 --> 04:42.159
Do I look even a little impatient to you?

04:49.250 --> 04:50.390
What was that about?

04:50.710 --> 04:52.240
Commander, didn't you just

04:52.890 --> 04:53.540
do this?

04:58.950 --> 04:59.920
I really

05:00.890 --> 05:02.690
was just trying to flick my hair.

05:02.990 --> 05:04.210
I... I'm sorry, Commander!

05:04.210 --> 05:05.040
Alright, alright.

05:05.040 --> 05:06.570
Clean this up immediately.

05:14.000 --> 05:14.680
Bai Yu.

05:15.860 --> 05:17.790
Have you captured Zhang Haiqi yet?

05:25.800 --> 05:27.360
Do you have any idea how much

05:27.870 --> 05:30.240
manpower and resources I spent
trying to avenge you?

05:30.240 --> 05:32.440
If you really want to repay my kindness,

05:33.040 --> 05:35.690
bring me a few more useful members
of the Zhang family.

05:35.690 --> 05:37.740
That would be worth far more
than anything else.

05:37.740 --> 05:38.470
Understood.

05:46.250 --> 05:46.930
Report!

05:47.159 --> 05:47.980
Come in. Just come in.

05:47.980 --> 05:49.390
Stop knocking already.

05:51.830 --> 05:54.250
Commander, when we passed through
the tunnel just now,

05:54.250 --> 05:55.500
someone tried to force her way
onto the train.

05:55.500 --> 05:56.920
But she's highly skilled—

05:56.920 --> 05:58.750
she actually managed to
evade a barrage of gunfire

05:58.750 --> 05:59.690
and suffered only minor injuries.

05:59.690 --> 06:01.860
Our men have captured her.

06:03.010 --> 06:06.560
Who would have the nerve to barge onto
my special train?

06:06.810 --> 06:08.830
We don't know her exact identity yet,

06:08.830 --> 06:10.540
but while we were apprehending her,

06:10.540 --> 06:13.000
we also received a telegram
from Zhang Qishan.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.310
It only said one thing—

06:14.310 --> 06:17.240
that she's the person
you've been longing for, Commander.

06:17.240 --> 06:17.860
A

06:18.420 --> 06:19.720
woman surnamed Zhang.

06:20.580 --> 06:21.780
Here's the telegram.

06:26.870 --> 06:29.590
[Telegram Draft]

06:28.130 --> 06:29.040
This woman came to my residence

06:29.040 --> 06:30.390
seeking a partnership.

06:30.480 --> 06:32.420
She wanted evidence of your corruption
and abuse of power in Beilian.

06:32.420 --> 06:33.190
Out of consideration
for our years as colleagues,

06:33.190 --> 06:34.320
I had no wish to involve myself
in this matter.

06:34.320 --> 06:36.130
Furthermore, this woman bears
a Qilin tattoo on her body

06:36.130 --> 06:37.430
that only appears when her blood runs hot.

06:37.430 --> 06:39.500
I've heard that you've long searched for
such a person without success,

06:39.500 --> 06:41.870
so I deliberately revealed
your whereabouts to her

06:41.870 --> 06:44.800
and leave her in your hands
to deal with as you see fit.

06:49.010 --> 06:49.670
Commander,

06:50.130 --> 06:51.130
what do you think?

06:52.180 --> 06:53.190
Zhang Qishan?

06:54.300 --> 06:55.810
He may act friendly towards me
on the surface,

06:55.810 --> 06:58.040
but he's stabbed me in the back
so many times.

06:58.040 --> 06:59.240
This is just his way of

06:59.570 --> 07:02.430
clearing himself of suspicion—

07:03.160 --> 07:05.780
worried I might think
he's one of the Zhang family.

07:05.780 --> 07:07.510
Bring in that woman you caught.

07:07.740 --> 07:09.270
I want to see her for myself.

07:09.810 --> 07:10.740
Yes, Commander!

07:39.870 --> 07:41.310
What kind of life

07:41.830 --> 07:43.159
am I living all day long?

08:13.930 --> 08:16.330
I was wondering
why you looked so familiar.

08:19.270 --> 08:20.510
[File Name: Investigation Report on
the Southern Archives & the Zhang Family]

08:20.580 --> 08:22.950
You're the Director of
the Southern Archives,

08:20.630 --> 08:23.540
[Report]

08:24.020 --> 08:25.080
Zhang Haiqi.

08:42.740 --> 08:44.510
The supreme god,

08:46.120 --> 08:48.120
there is none who can compare to you.

08:48.790 --> 08:51.020
We are mired in filth and insignificance,

08:51.020 --> 08:53.350
yet you still bestowed your favor upon me.

09:10.980 --> 09:13.640
I've spent half my life
searching for your kind.

09:15.250 --> 09:18.580
Do you know how many people
from the Archives I've captured?

09:18.720 --> 09:21.050
I found they were very different
from ordinary people.

09:21.050 --> 09:23.050
It was only after poring over countless
ancient texts

09:23.050 --> 09:24.510
that I finally understood

09:24.650 --> 09:25.840
that you belong to

09:26.290 --> 09:28.540
an ancient clan bearing the surname Zhang.

09:28.540 --> 09:29.950
Within your clan,

09:29.970 --> 09:31.260
there's a legend:

09:31.320 --> 09:32.650
every so often,

09:32.650 --> 09:35.390
a prodigy of the age is born—

09:36.040 --> 09:37.400
one whose existence

09:37.420 --> 09:39.750
threatens the safety of your entire clan.

09:41.950 --> 09:43.370
Having seen you today,

09:43.390 --> 09:44.920
it seems the legend is true.

09:45.520 --> 09:47.020
I'm deeply ashamed.

09:48.590 --> 09:50.520
There is no prodigy of this age.

09:51.010 --> 09:53.590
The fact that you pose a threat
to the Zhang family

09:53.590 --> 09:55.520
is the Zhang family's own problem.

09:59.630 --> 10:01.600
Let's move on to the next question:

10:01.890 --> 10:04.420
why did Zhang Qishan bring you

10:04.440 --> 10:05.730
onto my train?

10:06.130 --> 10:07.330
What are you two up to?

10:11.250 --> 10:12.530
As for what Zhang Qishan is up to,

10:12.530 --> 10:13.840
you should ask him.

10:14.220 --> 10:16.020
Scratching each other's backs—

10:16.910 --> 10:19.670
I suppose there's some kind of deal
between you two.

10:19.670 --> 10:20.360
Indeed.

10:22.600 --> 10:23.770
As expected of you.

10:25.070 --> 10:28.500
[Telegram Draft]

10:34.540 --> 10:37.130
[Telegram Draft]

10:35.870 --> 10:36.790
Send this

10:37.490 --> 10:38.880
to Zhang Qishan.

10:38.910 --> 10:39.840
Yes, Commander.

10:49.360 --> 10:51.550
If your goal has always been
to capture members of the Zhang family,

10:51.550 --> 10:52.720
then you've already caught

10:52.720 --> 10:54.240
me, a member of the Zhang family.

10:54.240 --> 10:56.980
So can you call off the release
of the Twilight Grass?

10:56.980 --> 10:58.460
Actually, I'm not interested in

10:58.460 --> 11:00.440
capturing all of you Zhangs.

11:01.550 --> 11:04.000
There's only one specific person
from the Zhang family

11:04.000 --> 11:06.100
that I'm after.

11:08.530 --> 11:09.240
However,

11:10.030 --> 11:12.700
since you're a member of the Zhang family,

11:12.700 --> 11:14.070
you must know

11:14.090 --> 11:15.340
where that person is.

11:15.550 --> 11:17.250
And you must

11:17.250 --> 11:18.620
have his file, too.

11:21.510 --> 11:24.170
It might even be sitting in your hands
right now.

11:25.030 --> 11:26.790
I've already destroyed the Archives.

11:26.790 --> 11:28.320
If you want to find his file,

11:28.860 --> 11:30.120
go dig for it yourself.

11:30.650 --> 11:31.370
However,

11:32.410 --> 11:34.610
I'm afraid you won't live until then.

11:34.910 --> 11:36.040
That's impossible.

11:36.320 --> 11:38.510
He'll definitely show himself eventually.

11:38.510 --> 11:39.170
As

11:39.670 --> 11:41.030
more and more of

11:41.030 --> 11:42.480
you Zhangs disappear,

11:42.790 --> 11:44.740
he'll realize

11:44.740 --> 11:46.270
that he's the one I'm after.

11:46.570 --> 11:49.010
And when he does, he'll come to me
of his own accord.

11:49.010 --> 11:51.070
I have great respect for your people.

11:51.280 --> 11:53.340
That's why I won't let
any part of you go to waste—

11:53.340 --> 11:55.240
not a single one of you,

11:55.240 --> 11:56.320
nor a single item

11:56.750 --> 11:58.100
belonging to you.

12:09.740 --> 12:11.130
Zhang Haiqi.

12:11.130 --> 12:13.930
Do you think it's possible
that this bodyguard...

12:14.520 --> 12:17.020
It's his first time serving as
my bodyguard.

12:25.890 --> 12:27.090
You were responsible

12:27.240 --> 12:29.810
for distracting me,

12:30.250 --> 12:30.910
while he

12:30.910 --> 12:32.180
put on another face

12:32.320 --> 12:33.940
and infiltrated my train as a bodyguard.

12:33.940 --> 12:37.990
As we speak, he's probably
looking for proof of my plans.

12:39.980 --> 12:41.250
Once we're on the train,

12:41.250 --> 12:42.820
I'll deal with Mo Yungao,

12:42.820 --> 12:45.510
and you go find evidence of
his poisoning scheme.

12:45.510 --> 12:47.030
If there's any Twilight Grass
on the train,

12:47.030 --> 12:48.050
destroy it all.

12:48.170 --> 12:50.410
We cannot allow even a single stalk
to enter Nanling.

12:50.410 --> 12:51.410
Darn it.

12:53.870 --> 12:55.170
Zhang Haitong?

12:56.390 --> 12:57.500
Zhang Haiqing?

12:58.860 --> 13:00.000
Zhang Haijiang?

13:01.380 --> 13:02.890
Zhang Haimu.

13:03.220 --> 13:04.290
Zhang Hairong.

13:07.080 --> 13:08.650
Zhang Haiping.

13:09.740 --> 13:11.390
Zhang Haicai.

13:11.390 --> 13:13.650
They're all members of the Zhang family.

13:24.960 --> 13:26.020
What are you doing?

13:27.790 --> 13:28.840
This is not mine.

13:29.240 --> 13:30.290
You remember that assassin

13:30.290 --> 13:31.490
named Bai Zhu, right?

13:39.240 --> 13:39.670
I...

13:39.670 --> 13:41.530
I-I'm on my way to send a telegram.

13:43.430 --> 13:44.570
I want you.

13:45.050 --> 13:45.550
What?

13:50.650 --> 13:52.910
Well, the Commander is still waiting.

13:52.910 --> 13:54.750
How about we do it in a bit?

13:56.840 --> 13:58.170
I want it now.

13:59.470 --> 14:00.120
No, no, no,

14:00.120 --> 14:01.450
this is inappropriate.

14:04.030 --> 14:05.210
I-It hurts!

14:05.670 --> 14:06.170
Ouch!

14:07.170 --> 14:08.430
I want your hand first.

14:09.670 --> 14:09.820
[Zhang Haiqing] [Zhang Haijiang]

14:16.270 --> 14:17.170
Ouch! It hurts!

14:17.170 --> 14:18.150
It really hurts!

14:55.450 --> 14:57.380
What the hell did you grow up eating

14:57.400 --> 14:58.430
to be so strong?

15:00.940 --> 15:02.170
People like you.

15:06.110 --> 15:07.030
Liquor?

15:08.850 --> 15:12.050
You make medicinal liquor
with the Zhang family members?

15:12.480 --> 15:14.080
It must be a great tonic, huh?

15:29.480 --> 15:30.650
Trust

15:30.650 --> 15:31.890
is the greatest trap.

15:32.240 --> 15:34.040
Whatever you place your trust in

15:34.080 --> 15:36.480
is exactly what will lead to
your downfall.

15:37.170 --> 15:37.980
Miss,

15:37.980 --> 15:38.750
look,

15:38.750 --> 15:40.320
didn't we hook up before?

15:40.370 --> 15:41.790
On the Nan'an?

15:41.810 --> 15:42.700
I remember now.

15:42.700 --> 15:43.300
You are...

15:43.600 --> 15:44.360
Bai Zhu, right?

15:44.360 --> 15:45.220
You... You...

15:45.220 --> 15:46.150
What did you say?

15:46.510 --> 15:48.580
One night together means something!

15:48.580 --> 15:49.800
We may be enemies,

15:50.200 --> 15:51.550
but I did let you leave that ship.

15:51.550 --> 15:53.500
You can't just turn your back on me
like that, right?

15:53.500 --> 15:54.240
Bullshit!

15:55.240 --> 15:56.790
Zhang Haiqi killed my sister.

15:56.790 --> 15:58.190
I'm going to kill you all.

15:58.250 --> 16:00.670
W-What are you talking about,

16:01.220 --> 16:02.230
Bai Zhu?

16:02.670 --> 16:04.100
I'm not Bai Zhu!

16:04.100 --> 16:05.770
Then who are you?

16:11.890 --> 16:12.550
Bai Yu!

16:20.550 --> 16:21.680
Is everything okay?

16:22.890 --> 16:23.820
Yeah, everything's okay.

16:23.820 --> 16:25.050
I just knocked some things over,

16:25.050 --> 16:26.310
and I'm cleaning it up.

16:33.440 --> 16:34.300
Lift your head.

16:40.220 --> 16:41.530
Are you guys...

16:42.360 --> 16:43.290
Okay?

16:43.290 --> 16:44.350
How could we not be?

16:45.150 --> 16:45.550
Go

16:46.720 --> 16:48.920
and send this telegram to Zhang Qishan.

16:58.910 --> 16:59.970
Where's my sister?

17:00.100 --> 17:01.700
You said she got off the ship.

17:05.150 --> 17:08.079
You're just locking the two of us up
in here like this?

17:08.550 --> 17:10.550
You do realize I could kill you right now,
don't you?

17:10.550 --> 17:11.720
You're so beautiful,

17:11.720 --> 17:13.349
yet your heart is so vicious.

17:13.750 --> 17:16.349
At least let me finish
this glass of wine first.

17:19.310 --> 17:22.109
The master of these snakes
is right next door,

17:22.660 --> 17:24.140
using his own way

17:25.180 --> 17:27.109
to manipulate them and protect me.

17:27.680 --> 17:29.480
This is all Chen Xifeng's doing.

17:30.480 --> 17:33.050
Bailejing really is a remarkable place.

17:34.050 --> 17:35.660
I've got quite a few talented

17:36.070 --> 17:38.400
and extraordinary people
working under me now as well.

17:38.400 --> 17:40.140
So you've known all along.

17:41.010 --> 17:42.110
This kind of snake

17:42.270 --> 17:44.000
is known as the Fidelity Snake.

17:44.140 --> 17:46.250
It can tell friend from foe
and expose impostors.

17:46.250 --> 17:48.510
So in front of me, disguises are useless.

17:52.940 --> 17:54.030
Now then,

17:55.250 --> 17:56.650
we'll wait for my men

17:56.880 --> 17:58.240
to bring back that friend of yours—

17:58.240 --> 18:01.300
the one posing as a bodyguard
with that fake face of his.

18:01.350 --> 18:03.590
Then we'll talk about what happens next.

18:03.590 --> 18:05.170
Of course, you could always

18:05.380 --> 18:06.880
throw something at me right now

18:06.880 --> 18:08.660
and punch a hole through my throat,

18:08.660 --> 18:11.060
just as that Salty Zhang once did.

18:11.380 --> 18:13.850
You should be faster than a snake.

18:14.380 --> 18:15.780
But bear with me for a bit.

18:20.790 --> 18:22.140
Beneath your sofa,

18:22.140 --> 18:24.430
I've placed one of my latest creations.

18:24.480 --> 18:26.590
It's a special powder ground from

18:26.590 --> 18:29.250
the blossoms of the Twilight Grass.

18:29.700 --> 18:32.850
I call it Yellow Jasmine.

18:33.270 --> 18:35.360
Do you have any idea how difficult it was

18:35.360 --> 18:37.060
to make the Twilight Grass bloom,

18:37.060 --> 18:39.590
and how many human lives it took
to feed them?

18:39.810 --> 18:40.660
This poison

18:40.750 --> 18:43.400
is much stronger than
anything I've made before.

18:43.400 --> 18:45.720
And you happen to be the perfect
test subject.

18:45.720 --> 18:48.920
There's a neutralizing serum
mixed into my daily coffee.

18:49.380 --> 18:51.840
You, on the other hand,
aren't so fortunate.

18:52.180 --> 18:53.110
Well? You can't even lift

18:53.110 --> 18:54.750
your arms right now, can you?

18:58.900 --> 19:00.100
Sorry to disappoint,

19:00.440 --> 19:02.510
but I'm of the Hai branch
of the Zhang family.

19:02.510 --> 19:04.040
We have very subtle breath.

19:04.510 --> 19:06.270
We can take one breath
and stay underwater for a long time.

19:06.270 --> 19:07.870
That's our special ability.

19:07.980 --> 19:09.830
And we don't need to gasp for air

19:09.830 --> 19:11.360
the way ordinary people do.

19:28.590 --> 19:29.670
Now talk.

19:30.220 --> 19:31.820
What exactly is your scheme?

19:32.280 --> 19:35.740
Where exactly are you planning to
release the Twilight Grass?

19:44.230 --> 19:45.630
You are making it feel...

19:45.740 --> 19:46.800
A bit too good.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.640
Speak, or you will die.

19:57.740 --> 20:00.200
You're the person
who looks the most like him

20:00.200 --> 20:01.900
out of anyone I've ever seen!

20:02.660 --> 20:05.150
And you're darn good-looking!

20:06.000 --> 20:08.260
Makes me hate the thought of killing you!

20:19.050 --> 20:20.710
Watch where you're shooting!

20:20.870 --> 20:22.000
So...

20:22.180 --> 20:25.000
You're the older sister, Bai Yu?

20:25.980 --> 20:27.180
Don't you want to know

20:27.200 --> 20:29.130
where your sister got off the ship?

20:40.610 --> 20:41.540
What do you want?

20:42.940 --> 20:43.900
I want to know

20:44.070 --> 20:46.930
the locations of all your deployment
in every city.

20:47.200 --> 20:49.830
If the Twilight Grass Poison
breaks out in the city,

20:49.830 --> 20:51.010
I assure you

20:51.010 --> 20:52.330
that your sister will definitely

20:52.330 --> 20:54.010
die from poisoning in the city.

20:54.010 --> 20:55.410
She misses you very much.

20:55.680 --> 20:57.610
She also wants to reunite with you.

20:59.030 --> 20:59.660
Don't you

21:00.810 --> 21:01.720
want that too?

21:11.030 --> 21:13.830
You want to stop the release of
the Twilight Grass?

21:14.660 --> 21:15.220
Yes.

21:19.050 --> 21:20.550
We've stationed suicide squads

21:20.550 --> 21:22.350
in cities all across the region.

21:22.750 --> 21:25.210
The Commander will notify them
by telegram.

21:25.510 --> 21:27.110
Once they receive the order,

21:27.270 --> 21:29.400
they'll start spreading
the Twilight Grass.

21:29.400 --> 21:30.160
Then,

21:31.010 --> 21:33.270
what if they don't receive the telegram?

21:34.030 --> 21:36.310
Then the plan will be activated

21:36.660 --> 21:37.790
at noon next Monday.

21:38.460 --> 21:39.920
I lead the team in Nanling.

21:40.380 --> 21:40.980
However,

21:42.770 --> 21:44.970
it won't be next Monday at noon anymore.

21:45.090 --> 21:45.570
Why?

21:45.900 --> 21:47.010
Because you just

21:48.190 --> 21:51.050
gave the telegram
for releasing the Twilight Grass

21:51.660 --> 21:53.060
to the telegraph office.

21:54.180 --> 21:55.580
What? I...

21:55.610 --> 21:57.610
That telegram from earlier
was the coded order

21:57.610 --> 21:59.440
to be sent to every deployment site.

21:59.440 --> 22:00.980
If the Commander gave it to you,

22:00.980 --> 22:02.740
then he intended for you to personally

22:02.740 --> 22:03.740
send out the order

22:03.900 --> 22:06.230
and set the Twilight Grass plan in motion.

22:12.510 --> 22:13.680
Now, what about my sister?

22:13.680 --> 22:14.420
Where is she?

22:22.510 --> 22:23.340
Your sister

22:24.030 --> 22:25.360
is on Kaiyuan Road,

22:25.940 --> 22:27.380
Xiacheng, and...

22:45.200 --> 22:50.410
[Nanling Station]

22:50.540 --> 22:54.100
[Guangchuan to Nanling]

23:10.240 --> 23:11.130
How's it going?

23:11.150 --> 23:12.200
Mo Yungao has sent out a coded order

23:12.200 --> 23:14.030
for all stations to start preparing
the Twilight Grass.

23:14.030 --> 23:15.900
The train is arriving at
Nanling Station soon.

23:15.900 --> 23:18.740
Our key task this time is
to deal with the Twilight Grass.

23:18.740 --> 23:19.400
It seems

23:19.420 --> 23:20.880
that coded telegram just now

23:20.880 --> 23:23.140
wasn't meant for Zhang Qishan after all.

23:23.240 --> 23:24.330
We must get the exact

23:24.330 --> 23:26.290
poisoning locations
to Zhang Qishan immediately.

23:26.290 --> 23:28.550
We must prevent the release at all costs.

23:28.960 --> 23:29.980
I'll go send the telegram.

23:29.980 --> 23:32.040
I'll go deal with the Twilight Grass.

23:33.660 --> 23:35.130
Get off immediately after it's done.

23:35.130 --> 23:36.310
Hold them off for 3 minutes.

23:36.310 --> 23:36.750
Got it.

24:41.070 --> 24:43.790
[Exit]

24:43.820 --> 24:44.690
[Guangchuan to Nanling]

24:47.000 --> 24:49.170
[Nanling Station]

24:53.240 --> 24:54.310
[Report]

24:54.310 --> 24:55.740
[Confidential Report on
the Twilight Grass Cultivation Experiment]

24:55.110 --> 24:57.000
Once the Twilight Grass seeds
enter a human body,

24:55.840 --> 25:00.750
[Report]

24:57.000 --> 24:58.310
they reproduce and grow inside it,

24:58.310 --> 25:00.310
eventually sprouting into new plants.

25:00.310 --> 25:03.250
This kind of grass thrives in
dark, damp environments.

25:03.250 --> 25:05.050
If exposed to intense heat and dryness,

25:05.050 --> 25:06.680
it withers and dies easily.

25:07.830 --> 25:09.980
That's why Mo Yungao has been
killing people all this time—

25:09.980 --> 25:11.610
to use their corpses
to cultivate the Twilight Grass.

25:10.480 --> 25:11.680
[Zhang Haisheng]

25:12.380 --> 25:13.420
Scum.

25:17.040 --> 25:17.920
[Zhang Haihan]

25:17.440 --> 25:18.830
He even used the bodies
of Zhang family members

25:18.830 --> 25:20.240
as fertilizer for the Twilight Grass.

25:19.130 --> 25:20.150
[Zhang Haiju]

25:21.810 --> 25:22.440
[Zhang Ming]

25:22.250 --> 25:23.580
So much Twilight Grass.

25:24.510 --> 25:25.710
There's no time left.

25:26.790 --> 25:28.790
Fellow members of the Zhang family,

25:31.790 --> 25:33.250
let me send you on your way.

26:05.140 --> 26:06.160
I told you to take care of the grass,

26:06.160 --> 26:07.490
not to blow up the train.

26:07.880 --> 26:10.940
When are you ever going to
stop giving me heart attacks?

26:11.740 --> 26:12.470
Don't worry.

26:12.590 --> 26:13.590
This is the outskirts.

26:13.590 --> 26:15.390
No innocent people will be hurt.

26:17.010 --> 26:18.470
Take a look at this report.

26:19.330 --> 26:21.860
This is the best way
to destroy the toxic weed.

26:32.880 --> 26:36.170
Notice to all personnel in every city:

26:36.520 --> 26:38.680
the deployment times and locations

26:38.720 --> 26:40.930
transmitted in the previous telegram

26:40.950 --> 26:42.350
are hereby null and void.

26:42.540 --> 26:45.400
This new order
supersedes all prior instructions.

26:45.790 --> 26:49.290
The revised deployment schedule,
locations, and methods

26:50.340 --> 26:51.340
are as follows...

26:55.490 --> 26:57.970
[Suburban River Channel, Changxiang]

27:03.750 --> 27:05.410
Telegram from the Commander.

27:08.440 --> 27:09.940
Orders from the Commander!

27:09.940 --> 27:12.530
The deployment locations and schedule
have been revised.

27:12.530 --> 27:13.720
Adjust the operation at once!

27:13.720 --> 27:14.330
Yes!

27:15.220 --> 27:15.980
Come on. Hurry up.

27:15.980 --> 27:16.780
Get in! Get in!

27:19.090 --> 27:19.610
Come on!

27:25.950 --> 27:27.710
[Guangchuan]

27:40.590 --> 27:41.370
Hurry up!

27:41.390 --> 27:42.440
We are running out of time!

27:42.440 --> 27:43.500
Hurry up! Hurry up!

27:44.350 --> 27:46.480
[Suburban Highland Slope, Changxiang]

27:51.010 --> 27:51.550
Get off!

28:01.100 --> 28:02.100
How could this be?

28:02.360 --> 28:04.350
We've changed the locations and schedule.

28:04.350 --> 28:05.430
How did you know?

28:09.070 --> 28:10.920
[One hour ago]

28:56.630 --> 28:57.250
[All]

28:59.630 --> 29:00.620
[All action]

29:02.490 --> 29:04.740
[All action units]

29:14.070 --> 29:15.270
Great Master Buddha.

29:15.740 --> 29:17.230
These are revisions to

29:16.840 --> 29:17.810
[Military Division]

29:17.400 --> 29:18.700
the Twilight Grass operation

29:17.830 --> 29:20.960
[The original deployment directive,
Order No. Hai-3, is hereby revoked immediately.]

29:19.070 --> 29:20.470
and personnel movements

29:20.500 --> 29:23.230
transmitted over
Mo Yungao's military channel.

29:23.510 --> 29:25.570
Zhang Haiqi has taken action.

29:27.220 --> 29:28.640
Compile this into a military report

29:28.640 --> 29:30.640
and notify Nanling and all other locations

29:30.640 --> 29:31.900
to hunt down Mo Yungao.

29:32.400 --> 29:33.600
Put that down!

29:34.010 --> 29:34.820
Stop there!

29:35.800 --> 29:36.510
Freeze!

29:39.250 --> 29:40.760
Left, right, left!

29:40.240 --> 29:41.730
[Twilight Grass Cultivation Area,
Mo Yungao's Base, Xiaojiang]

29:40.960 --> 29:42.410
Left, right, left!

29:41.750 --> 29:42.500
[Zhang Haixia's Location]

29:42.730 --> 29:44.190
Left, right, left!

29:44.380 --> 29:45.700
Left, right, left!

29:46.250 --> 29:47.550
Left, right, left!

29:48.050 --> 29:49.350
Left, right, left!

29:49.480 --> 29:52.550
Left, right, left, right!

29:57.030 --> 29:58.560
Left, right, left!

29:58.850 --> 30:00.420
Left, right, left!

30:00.810 --> 30:02.480
Left, right, left!

30:02.730 --> 30:04.740
Left, right, left!

30:06.480 --> 30:09.140
There are enemies
lying in wait on the back hill!

31:01.110 --> 31:01.770
Officer Li.

31:02.000 --> 31:03.880
The Seed Division would like you
to come over

31:03.880 --> 31:06.410
and review the progress of
seed germination.

31:08.270 --> 31:09.200
Reporting, sir.

31:09.460 --> 31:11.280
Enemy troops have been spotted
near the base.

31:11.280 --> 31:13.180
This is the coded telegram
we just intercepted.

31:13.180 --> 31:14.720
We're working on deciphering it.

31:14.720 --> 31:16.920
Based on frequency analysis
and contextual inference,

31:16.920 --> 31:17.700
we've essentially worked out

31:17.700 --> 31:19.070
their encryption scheme.

31:19.070 --> 31:21.870
These are the key terms
we've managed to decipher.

31:22.160 --> 31:22.860
Officer Li,

31:23.770 --> 31:24.870
please take a look.

31:26.310 --> 31:27.380
Tell me,

31:28.010 --> 31:30.420
why do some members of the Zhang family

31:28.420 --> 31:31.310
[Li Pinrui, Researcher of
the Twilight Grass Project]

31:31.270 --> 31:34.160
have antibodies against
the Twilight Grass?

31:40.790 --> 31:42.200
Why do you think that is?

31:43.420 --> 31:44.610
I think...

31:45.180 --> 31:46.850
I think there's an emergency.

31:47.760 --> 31:49.260
We just intercepted a coded telegram.

31:49.260 --> 31:51.860
[Great Master Buddha Reinforcements]

31:56.920 --> 31:58.120
Great Master Buddha.

31:58.660 --> 31:59.660
Reinforcements.

32:01.940 --> 32:02.910
Tell me.

32:03.110 --> 32:05.910
If we use Zhang Qishan
to plant the Twilight Grass,

32:06.660 --> 32:08.030
what would happen?

32:09.160 --> 32:09.680
Report!

32:09.940 --> 32:11.380
The enemy is jamming us.

32:11.380 --> 32:13.440
All communication systems are down.

32:26.250 --> 32:29.380
What did the coded telegram
we intercepted earlier say?

32:32.570 --> 32:38.800
[Telegram]

32:33.140 --> 32:36.010
This was the last one we picked up
before communications were lost.

32:36.010 --> 32:38.140
We haven't had time to decipher it yet.

32:38.920 --> 32:39.500
Sir,

32:40.140 --> 32:41.880
they've switched to
a new encryption method.

32:41.880 --> 32:43.700
It's a neighboring-letter cipher.

32:43.700 --> 32:46.570
[Telegram]

32:44.770 --> 32:47.770
Everyone, start testing
possible keys immediately!

32:48.590 --> 32:50.550
The first group of words is the key.

32:51.750 --> 32:53.180
The actual military report doesn't begin

32:53.180 --> 32:55.050
until the second group.

32:55.740 --> 32:57.740
Before encryption, this letter "S"

32:57.850 --> 33:00.250
would have been either "R" or "T"—

33:00.900 --> 33:02.680
which one it is

33:02.770 --> 33:05.070
depends on the context.

33:05.070 --> 33:06.570
But if that's the case,

33:07.550 --> 33:09.590
wouldn't the 22 encrypted English segments

33:09.590 --> 33:12.050
yield an enormous number
of possible combinations?

33:12.050 --> 33:13.640
To be exact,

33:13.640 --> 33:15.750
there are

33:15.750 --> 33:17.740
4,194,304 possibilities.

33:22.250 --> 33:22.900
Someone!

33:27.750 --> 33:29.720
There are 3 battalions moving in on us.

33:29.720 --> 33:30.850
Send a team to check.

33:31.160 --> 33:31.590
Yes.

33:32.100 --> 33:33.610
[No Trespassing]

33:32.380 --> 33:33.070
Squad One.

33:33.270 --> 33:33.790
Hurry!

33:33.790 --> 33:35.480
Head to the east of the base immediately

33:35.480 --> 33:37.720
and check if
there are 3 battalions approaching.

33:37.720 --> 33:38.580
The rest of you,

33:38.700 --> 33:40.290
defend the base fortress to the death.

33:40.290 --> 33:41.440
There must not be
the slightest lapse in vigilance!

33:41.440 --> 33:42.240
Hurry! Hurry!

34:12.500 --> 34:13.530
Our outer defense system

34:13.530 --> 34:14.679
has been dismantled by them.

34:14.679 --> 34:16.840
There are also enemy footprints
and tire tracks.

34:16.840 --> 34:19.370
Go back immediately
and report to Officer Li.

34:21.500 --> 34:22.429
Reporting, sir.

34:22.550 --> 34:23.880
Ten kilometers east of the base,

34:23.880 --> 34:25.710
someone has dismantled
the explosives guarding the base.

34:25.710 --> 34:26.710
We found enemy footprints

34:26.710 --> 34:28.210
and tire tracks there as well.

34:28.210 --> 34:30.010
Judging by the trail, they appear to
have moved toward the rear of the base.

34:30.010 --> 34:31.460
Sir, what should we do next?

34:31.460 --> 34:32.860
The base is under attack!

34:32.920 --> 34:34.320
The base is under attack!

34:35.530 --> 34:37.710
Zhang Qishan's troops are here.

34:38.280 --> 34:39.420
Move my seeds out of here immediately!

34:39.420 --> 34:39.880
Yes.

34:57.860 --> 34:59.560
Everyone, assemble!

34:59.650 --> 35:01.000
Prepare for battle!

35:04.260 --> 35:04.720
Report!

35:06.630 --> 35:07.820
We found an enemy.

35:07.820 --> 35:08.680
Bring him here!

35:09.420 --> 35:10.090
We can't bring him here.

35:10.090 --> 35:11.950
You'll have to go there yourself.

35:16.780 --> 35:18.110
Is Zhang Qishan here?

35:26.130 --> 35:27.190
It doesn't matter.

35:28.090 --> 35:30.260
Because you're all about to die.

35:31.590 --> 35:32.250
It seems

35:32.610 --> 35:34.070
Zhang Qishan didn't come.

35:35.600 --> 35:37.530
Are you also from the Zhang family?

35:38.190 --> 35:39.910
Tell all your men to come out

35:40.320 --> 35:41.920
and surrender your weapons.

35:41.960 --> 35:43.030
I'll ask the Commander

35:43.030 --> 35:44.240
to spare your lives

35:44.460 --> 35:45.570
and give you the honor of

35:45.570 --> 35:47.100
becoming my test subjects!

35:51.230 --> 35:52.000
Ready your weapons!
